sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor System as 系统Crontab
    participant RunCmd as Run命令<br/>(wscrontab:run)
    participant Manager as CrontabManager
    participant ConfigRepo as ConfigTaskRepository
    participant DBRepo as DatabaseTaskRepository
    participant Cron as CronExpression
    participant Event as Event系统
    participant Executor as TaskExecutor
    participant Lock as TaskLock
    participant Process as Symfony Process
    participant LogDB as TaskLogModel

    Note over System: 每分钟触发一次

    System->>RunCmd: php think wscrontab:run

    RunCmd->>Manager: new CrontabManager(config)
    RunCmd->>Manager: dispatch()

    Note over Manager: === 加载任务（DB优先） ===

    Manager->>DBRepo: isAvailable()?
    alt 数据库可用
        Manager->>DBRepo: all()
        DBRepo-->>Manager: 数据库任务列表
    end

    Manager->>ConfigRepo: all()
    ConfigRepo-->>Manager: 配置文件任务列表

    Note over Manager: 合并任务<br/>数据库覆盖同名配置任务

    Note over Manager: === 遍历到期任务 ===

    loop 每个启用任务
        Manager->>Cron: new CronExpression(task.cron_expression)
        Manager->>Cron: isDue('now')
        Cron-->>Manager: true/false

        alt 任务到期
            Manager->>Event: trigger(BeforeTaskExecute)
            Event-->>Manager: 事件已分发

            Note over Manager: 检查 allow_concurrent

            alt allow_concurrent = false
                Manager->>Lock: acquire(task.name)
                Lock-->>Manager: true (获取锁成功)
            end

            Manager->>Executor: execute(task, lock)

            Note over Executor: === 子进程执行 ===

            Executor->>LogDB: 创建日志(status=running)
            LogDB-->>Executor: log

            Executor->>Process: new Process(task.command)
            Executor->>Process: setTimeout(task.timeout)
            Executor->>Process: run()

            Process-->>Executor: exit_code, stdout, stderr

            Note over Executor: 计算 duration

            alt exit_code = 0
                Executor->>LogDB: 更新日志(status=success)
                Executor->>Event: trigger(AfterTaskExecute)
            else exit_code != 0
                Note over Executor: 判断是否需要重试
                alt retry_count < max_retries
                    Note over Executor: 递归重试 execute()
                else 超过重试次数
                    Executor->>LogDB: 更新日志(status=failure)
                    Executor->>Event: trigger(TaskExecuteFailed)
                end
            end

            Executor->>Lock: release(task.name)
            Executor-->>Manager: 执行结果

        else 任务未到期
            Note over Manager: 跳过
        end
    end

    Manager-->>RunCmd: 调度统计
    RunCmd-->>System: return 0

---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as 调用方
    participant Executor as TaskExecutor
    participant Lock as TaskLock
    participant Model as TaskLogModel
    participant Process as Symfony Process

    Caller->>Executor: execute(task, lock)

    Note over Executor: Step 1: 防并发检查

    Executor->>Lock: acquire(task.name)
    alt 获取锁失败（已被锁定）
        Lock-->>Executor: false
        Executor-->>Caller: {status: 'skipped', reason: 'locked'}
        Note over Executor: 任务被跳过（不视为失败）
    else 获取锁成功
        Lock-->>Executor: true

        Note over Executor: Step 2: 记录开始日志

        Executor->>Model: 创建 TaskLog
        Note over Model: status='running'<br/>start_time=now<br/>task_name=task.name

        Note over Executor: Step 3: 启动子进程

        Executor->>Process: new Process(task.command)
        Executor->>Process: setTimeout(task.timeout)
        Executor->>Process: run()

        alt 进程正常退出
            Process-->>Executor: exit_code, stdout, stderr
            Note over Executor: duration = end_time - start_time
        else 进程超时
            Process-->>Executor: timeout exception
            Note over Executor: exit_code = -1<br/>error_output = 'timeout'
        end

        Note over Executor: Step 4: 截断输出

        Executor->>Executor: truncateOutput(output)
        Note over Executor: 超过 output_max_bytes 截断

        Note over Executor: Step 5: 更新日志 + 事件

        alt exit_code = 0
            Executor->>Model: update TaskLog
            Note over Model: status='success'<br/>exit_code=0<br/>end_time=now<br/>duration=xxx
            Executor->>Executor: trigger(AfterTaskExecute)
            Executor-->>Caller: {status: 'success', exit_code: 0}
        else exit_code != 0
            opt retry_count < task.max_retries
                Executor->>Model: update TaskLog(retry_count++)
                Note over Executor: 递归调用 execute()
            end
            Executor->>Model: update TaskLog
            Note over Model: status='failure'<br/>exit_code=xxx<br/>end_time=now
            Executor->>Executor: trigger(TaskExecuteFailed)
            Executor-->>Caller: {status: 'failure', exit_code: xxx}
        end

        Note over Executor: Step 6: 释放锁

        Executor->>Lock: release(task.name)
    end
